{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 Farmch Revolution is an action roguelike that combines the <strong>Skill</strong> system of an AOS with the progression of a roguelike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your character's unique <strong>Skills</strong> to unpredictable levels and grow even stronger through synergies with <strong>Items</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118860/extras/1862e707f58a61eeccdcce63691b9514.apng?t=1772265329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118860/extras/1862e707f58a61eeccdcce63691b9514.poster.avif?t=1772265329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=995 height=645 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc37 Rescue the Baby Pig from the Butcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle to save a cute baby pig begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118860/extras/9169f36c7dde3b843d0194c7ccecb94e.poster.avif?t=1772265329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118860/extras/9169f36c7dde3b843d0194c7ccecb94e.webm?t=1772265329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118860/extras/9169f36c7dde3b843d0194c7ccecb94e.mp4?t=1772265329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Endless Possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 skills per character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 items &amp; more than 600 skill upgrades</p><p cl